  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `site/content/guide/getting-started/first-router-part.md` (`weight = 5`). It walks through a `140 x 100 x 12 mm` bracket plate in `200 x 160 x 12 mm` sheet stock using `Sienci AltMill 4x4` and `grblhal.cps`.\n- Covered corner `G54` setup, `EM-0600-4FL` flat end mill and `DR-0600` drill selection, dry `Drill -> 2D Pocket -> 2D Contour` (with four `8 x 3 mm` holding tabs) cut order, simulation/`Deviate`, common router refusals, posting, `RichAuto DSP A11` shop-router preparation (`FAT32`, `8.3` filenames, `AbsCntr = Off`, `C.A.D Thickness`, single-tool `.nc` workflow), and the `#1902` screenshot checklist.\n- Committed `examples/first-router-part.camproj`, verified gouge-free and warning-free through `posting::verification_gate` and `posting::post_setup`.\n- Linked the new guide from `site/content/guide/getting-started/_index.md`, `site/content/guide/getting-started/workflows.md`, and `site/content/guide/check-and-post/machines.md` (`## Router`).\n- Updated `site/tests/test_guide_navigation.py` to include `guide/getting-started/first-router-part` in the sidebar check.\n- Added `crates/app/tests/first_router_part.rs` and `docs/decisions/1917-first-router-part.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nNo getting-started walkthrough, committed router demo project, or RichAuto DSP A11 shop-router workflow existed in the user guide for CNC router users (`#1917`).\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins (`crates/app/tests/first_router_part.rs`):\n  - `first_router_part_project_loads_verifies_and_posts_to_grblhal`: red before fix (`expected committed router demo project`), green after fix (`1.18s`). Loads `examples/first-router-part.camproj`, asserts `Sienci AltMill 4x4`, `grblHAL`, box sheet stock, corner `G54`, flat end mill, `Drill1` -> `2D Pocket1` -> `2D Contour1` with holding tabs, zero gate warnings, valid `grblhal.cps` G-code output, and byte-identical output from `build_demo_world()`.\n  - `first_router_part_guide_and_navigation_links_exist_and_resolve`: red before fix (`missing guide page`), green after fix. Verifies required sections, resolves every internal `@/guide/...` Zola link on the page, checks links in `_index.md`, `workflows.md`, and `machines.md` (`## Router`), and checks `site/tests/test_guide_navigation.py` coverage.\n- Mutation checks (revert/remove -> red, restore -> green):\n  - `examples/first-router-part.camproj`: removed -> failed on missing demo project -> restored -> passed.\n  - `site/content/guide/getting-started/_index.md`: reverted -> failed -> restored -> passed.\n  - `site/content/guide/getting-started/workflows.md`: reverted -> failed -> restored -> passed.\n  - `site/content/guide/check-and-post/machines.md`: reverted -> failed -> restored -> passed.\n  - `site/tests/test_guide_navigation.py`: reverted -> failed -> restored -> passed.\n  - `site/content/guide/getting-started/first-router-part.md`: removed -> failed -> restored -> passed.\n- Gate and lint:\n  - `cargo run --manifest-path .claude/worktrees/issue-1917/Cargo.toml -p xtask -- gate quick --base upstream/main`: green (`1 step(s), 0 failed, 2s`).\n  - `cargo clippy --manifest-path .claude/worktrees/issue-1917/Cargo.toml -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green (`0 warnings`).\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `zola build` and `python3 -m unittest site/tests/test_guide_navigation.py` could not run locally because `zola` is not installed on PATH and running `python3` / outside binaries is blocked by sandbox permissions in this environment; all internal `@/...` links and `test_guide_navigation.py` coverage were verified in `crates/app/tests/first_router_part.rs` instead.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone checked at claim/PR creation (`_index.md`, `workflows.md`, `machines.md`, `test_guide_navigation.py` had zero conflicting open PRs).\n\nChangelog: Added the \"Your first router part\" guide page, Sienci AltMill 4x4 + grblHAL demo project, and RichAuto DSP A11 shop-router notes.\n\nFixes #1917\n",
